URL: https://download.gnome.org/sources/librsvg/2.58/librsvg-2.58.3.tar.xz d2553784cb788c6b800d10a1caf98a7cb993187507dcb6191a557cfed04c1b8c
Origname: librsvg-2.58.3
Name: librsvg

    librsvg 2.58.3 (SVG rendering; the Rust workspace is built with the Fil-C rustc via the two-compiler dispatch)
